It is hard to imagine what motivated you to set upon that vulnerable young woman, but given the vicious attack that transpired, it is quite possible that she discovered you there engaged in some type of disgraceful and embarrassing activity at a secluded spot, where your true self could emerge uninhibited, and where your deeper, darker urges and desires could reveal themselves. The obvious explanation that comes to mind is that Ms. Caudingly caught you or you approached her while you were engaged in some kind of activity of a sexual or perverted nature, and that she challenged you. Given that you took her mobile phone after you killed her.

