world upside down for years, and we all know a special part of our fun, tight-knit family is now gone forever due to the actions of this individual. Vanessa noted that her family would never forgive Raj Winder Singh, whom she pointedly refused to name, before adding that Toya wasn't the only victim of his actions. Singh had also victimized Marco Heidenreich and even his own family, with his wife and children becoming more collateral damage. Troy accordingly also spoke outside court, stating, Today's verdict has delivered a form of justice, but for us there can never be true justice as we now live in a world without Toya,

