and the world is a poorer place for it. But Toya will always be alive in our hearts and in the hearts of a great many others. Toya was Troy's only child, and the Troy's only child, of losing her and being the one to discover her body, left Troy with a number of mental health conditions, including PTSD. Toia is remembered as a loving, kind and generous daughter, sister and friend. She was close with both of her parents and appreciative of the upbringing they gave her. In an interview with the ABC, Troy remembered how happy Toya's childhood was, stating, I have other images permanently etched in my mind.

