Toya used to spend a week with her mother and a week with my partner and I as she grew up. I remember our backyard full of laughing happy kids. I remember wonderful birthday parties and Christmases. She always said how lucky she was to have two moms and two dads. Toya grew into a beautiful, caring young woman. We are all so proud of that. Toya and I shared a love that only a father and daughter can understand. I feel lost and empty inside, but will always have the wonderful memories of those 24 years.

